step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test the best single model hypothesis by evaluating the rf model alone.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"rf"}

Thought: Test the best_single hypothesis with the next top model, CWT_rf, to see if it beats rf alone.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"CWT_rf"}

Thought: Test trimmed_mean over the full pool with 20% trimming to see if robust average beats single rf.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test weighted combination using inverse error on a small, stable pool to see if it outperforms single rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["rf","catboost","CWT_rf","CWT_catboost","DWT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_catboost"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on pool4 to see if it can beat the best single rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool4 to see if averaging improves over the best single rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean over the small stable pool4 to see if trimming outliers improves over the median pool4.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Evaluate a robust median over the small, diverse pool1 to see if it can beat the best single rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a deterministic Bayesian averaging (dba) on the moderately sized pool2 to see if it can outperform the best single rf.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a robust median over pool3 to see if adding more diverse models improves over the best single rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a dba combination on the small, diverse pool1 to see if it improves over best_single rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a robust median over the slightly larger pool2 to see if adding rf and catboost improves over rf alone.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

